1
00:00:00,922 --> 00:00:03,152
(Stuart:)I'm sorry,
you mumbled something?

2
00:00:04,025 --> 00:00:05,795
(Raj:)It's just that

3
00:00:05,794 --> 00:00:07,824
(Raj:)they've had plenty of help.

4
00:00:07,829 --> 00:00:10,099
(Stuart:)Well, you know what they say--
it takes a village.

5
00:00:10,098 --> 00:00:12,568
(Raj:)Well, they already
had a village.

6
00:00:13,802 --> 00:00:15,602
(Stuart:)I noticed the village
couldn't find time

7
00:00:15,604 --> 00:00:17,134
(Stuart:)to put the crib together.

8
00:00:17,138 --> 00:00:18,368
(Raj:)Yeah, well, maybe

9
00:00:18,373 --> 00:00:20,143
(Raj:)the village was too busy
checking out

10
00:00:20,141 --> 00:00:21,911
(Raj:)the local Montessori school
for the new arrival.

11
00:00:21,910 --> 00:00:22,940
(Stuart:)You mean the one

12
00:00:22,944 --> 00:00:24,874
(Stuart:)with the empty beer bottles
in the sandbox?

13
00:00:24,880 --> 00:00:26,580
(Stuart:)We'll pass, thank you.

14
00:00:28,149 --> 00:00:31,049
(Bernadette:)Do something, Batman.

15
00:00:35,857 --> 00:00:38,057
(Leonard:)Hey.

16
00:00:39,728 --> 00:00:41,558
(Sheldon:)What do you think you're doing?

17
00:00:41,563 --> 00:00:44,593
(Leonard:)Separating my delicates.

18
00:00:45,901 --> 00:00:47,571
(Sheldon:)This is the level
you're stooping to.

19
00:00:47,569 --> 00:00:48,539
(Sheldon:)No.

20
00:00:48,536 --> 00:00:53,606
(Sheldon:)This is the level
I am stooping to.

21
00:00:57,045 --> 00:01:02,025
(Leonard:)I believe that is flag
to crotch four, checkmate.

